#: ../../source/docs/flytos.rst:5 09d9b341d5c84c9d9a7d7edbca0f273a
msgid "FlytOS"
msgstr "FlytOS"

#: ../../source/docs/flytos.rst:7 fe0616cf25354fc6a0daa57dc07493ad
msgid ""
"`FlytOS <https://flytbase.com>`__ is a software framework which provides "
"Drone APIs and SDKs for building high-level drone applications such as "
"aerial delivery, precision agriculture, surveys, photography, industrial "
"inspections and disaster management. It is designed to enable drone-"
"developers build advanced drone applications using its open APIs."
msgstr ""
"`FlytOS <https://flytbase.com>`__ 是一个软件框架，提供无人机 API 和 "
"SDK，用于构建高级无人机应用程序，如航空配送、精准农业、测量、摄影、工业检测和灾害管理。其设计旨在使无人机开发人员能够使用其开放 API "
"构建高级无人机应用程序。"

#: ../../source/docs/flytos.rst:9 13c34ac0e7e644578909526f57729595
msgid ""
"FlytOS is based on Linux and ROS (Robot Operating System), making it an "
"ideal platform for building commercial as well as research orientated drone "
"applications. It supports a wide range of hardware options such as "
"*Raspberry Pi 3, Odroid XU4, Nvidia TX1, Intel Edison, Intel Aero and "
"FlytPOD*. It uses MAVLink to communicate with the autopilot, and exposes "
"high level FlytAPIs in *ROS, CPP, Python, REST and Websocket*. |br|"
msgstr ""
"FlytOS 基于 Linux 和 ROS（机器人操作系统），是构建商业及科研无人机应用程序的理想平台。它支持多种硬件选项，如 *Raspberry "
"Pi 3、Odroid XU4、Nvidia TX1、Intel Edison、Intel Aero 和 FlytPOD*。它使用 MAVLink "
"与自动驾驶仪通信，并以 *ROS、CPP、Python、REST 和 Websocket* 形式暴露高级 FlytAPI。|br|"

#: ../../source/docs/flytos.rst:15 ../../source/docs/flytos.rst:40
#: 77e459bf3e55459e99b562c3f15aee11 b0dced01183b41d6903bfd5c23e9f7c2
msgid "Supported Companion Computers"
msgstr "支持的伴飞计算机"

#: ../../source/docs/flytos.rst:17 84e27af4ce294b76a52b117d37c0cfc0
msgid ""
"This makes it easy to build high-level applications using computer-vision, "
"machine-learning, cloud-connectivity and enables developers to create their "
"custom user-interfaces on web/mobile devices of their choice. FlytOS also "
"has modules to manage payloads, security and updates. The modular design of "
"FlytOS allows for integration with external ROS/Linux libraries and custom "
"data plumbing between onboard and offboard apps. FlytOS aims to provide a "
"standard language for the drone application developers to talk to their "
"drones."
msgstr ""
"这使得使用计算机视觉、机器学习、云连接构建高级应用程序变得容易，并使开发人员能够在其选择的网络/移动设备上创建自定义用户界面。FlytOS "
"还具有管理载荷、安全性和更新的模块。FlytOS 的模块化设计允许与外部 ROS/Linux "
"库集成，并在机载和离线应用程序之间进行自定义数据传输。FlytOS 旨在为无人机应用开发者提供与无人机通信的标准语言。"

