#: ../../source/docs/flytos.rst:57 7fe8fbdd52464b68ae8bc12584c4e65d
msgid ""
"FlytOS offers Drone APIs for building applications with onboard as well as "
"remote components. These drone APIs not only provide you, the control over "
"vehicle's navigation, payloads (gimbal, camera, etc.) but also has few "
"inbuilt AI/ML modules such as object detection and tracking, obstacle "
"detection etc."
msgstr ""
"FlytOS 提供无人机 API，用于构建具有机载和远程组件的应用程序。这些无人机 API "
"不仅为您提供对飞行器导航、载荷（云台、相机等）的控制，还内置了少量 AI/ML 模块，如目标检测与跟踪、障碍物检测等。"

#: ../../source/docs/flytos.rst:60 0d146f61bfc9402db399d0aedbd475be
msgid "Onboard APIs"
msgstr "机载 API"

#: ../../source/docs/flytos.rst:62 7ce81bd863f44b14ba02262e604cb83d
msgid ""
"These are APIs available onboard the companion computer and can be used for "
"developing domain specific intelligence and business logic. Typical "
"candidates are tasks requiring high reliability, low latency and relatively "
"low processing power as offered by the onboard computers."
msgstr ""
"这些是伴飞计算机上可用的 API，可用于开发领域特定的智能和业务逻辑。典型的应用场景是需要高可靠性、低延迟且机载计算机所提供的相对较低处理能力的任务。"

